#: ../../source/incoming/controller_attributes.rst:29
msgid "Disabling Attributes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/incoming/controller_attributes.rst:31
msgid ""
"If you know that you will not be using attributes in your application, "
"you can disable the feature by setting the ``$useControllerAttributes`` "
"property in your ``app/Config/Routing.php`` file to ``false``."
msgstr ""

